Adds:
- image_delivery_policies table (v46-v46c) with scope-based control
  Precedence: image > card > set > language > source > global
- takedown_cases + takedown_events tables (v47-v48c) with immutability triggers
- image_delivery_policy_records table (v49-v49d) for abuse monitoring
- derivative_cache table (v50-v50b) for safe image resizing
- physical_item_photos table (v51-v51c) for tenant-isolated uploads
- Image gateway route: GET /api/v1/images/assets/{id}/content
- Signed URL generation: POST /api/v1/images/assets/signed-url
- Admin policy endpoints: GET, POST /api/v1/admin/images/policies
- Admin global emergency switch: PUT /api/v1/admin/images/policies/global
- Admin takedown endpoints: cases create/list/resolve
- Rate limiting with per-key and per-identity buckets
- Delivery logging with 30-day retention policy
- Derivative generation with Pillow (no enlargement, metadata stripped)
- Safe path resolution (traversal prevention, symlink escape)
- Static /images mount removed — all delivery through gateway
- 37 new tests covering policy, takedown, auth, signed URL, rate limiting
- 133 total tests passing (37 v9.1 + 25 v9 + 71 v1+v8)

Preserves:
- All 300K+ existing images untouched
- v1 image metadata contract (backward compatible)
- Normal internal card rendering
- Existing 96 pre-v9.1 tests
